sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HH as Household resident
    actor Other as Trusted household resident
    participant App as Household mobile
    participant API as Household API
    participant DB as Household, event and status records
    HH->>App: Complete setup and confirm household/member identity
    App->>API: Save permitted setup and geotag
    API->>DB: Validate linked household and store allowed changes
    HH->>App: Review alert and select configured report status
    App->>API: Submit household/member status and available GPS
    API->>DB: Validate event/status, persist current state and history
    API-->>App: Confirm accepted report
    opt Report for trusted household
        HH->>API: Send connection invitation
        Other->>API: Accept or reject request
        HH->>App: Enter trusted PIN and select member
        App->>API: Verify active connection and PIN before reporting
        API->>DB: Save authorized member report and history
    end
    alt Submission rejected or network fails
        API-->>App: Show failure, do not claim successful synchronization
    else Accepted online
        App->>App: Refresh and persist last successful overview
    end
